{"projectInfo":{"name":"EIGRP聚合路由配置","path":"eigrp4","visibility":2,"categoryId":5882,"introduction":"Router A、Router B运行OSPF，Router D运行EIGRP，Router C同时运行OSPF和EIGRP。在Router C上配置EIGRP进程引入OSPF路由，使Router D有到达10.1.1.0/24、10.2.1.0/24、10.5.1.0/24和10.6.1.0/24网段的路由。为了减小Router D的路由表规模，在Router C上配置路由聚合，只发布聚合后的路由10.0.0.0/8。","label":["EIGRP"]},"deviceInfoList":[{"resourceName":"RTD","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTD.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTA","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTA.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTC","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTC.cfg"},{"resourceName":"RTB","resourceCategory":"路由器","resourceModel":"MSR36-20","resourceVersion":"CMW7.1.064-R0821P11","configPath":"DeviceConfig\\RTB.cfg"}]}